# CI test, lint and audit toolchain on top of the runtime set, mirroring
# [tool.poetry.group.dev.dependencies]. Hash-pinned in ci.txt so every
# `pip install` in .github/workflows is pinned (OpenSSF Scorecard
# Pinned-Dependencies); scripts/ci-install.sh installs it.
# Regenerate:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --universal --python-version 3.11 \
#     requirements/ci.in -o requirements/ci.txt
-r runtime.in
